    "input": "\"{\\\"graph\\\": null, \\\"update\\\": null, \\\"resume\\\": \\\"Sim, excluir definitivamente\\\", \\\"goto\\\": []}\"",
    "output": "\"{\\\"messages\\\": [{\\\"content\\\": \\\"Apague o cliente com cnpj 65410433218196 do banco. Estou ciente das consequencias. Pode excluir \\\", \\\"additional_kwargs\\\": {}, \\\"response_metadata\\\": {}, \\\"type\\\": \\\"human\\\", \\\"name\\\": null, \\\"id\\\": \\\"6b492436-ac96-407e-a78b-203da07eb8bb\\\"}, {\\\"content\\\": \\\"Excluir apenas o cadastro do cliente em clientes\\\", \\\"additional_kwargs\\\": {}, \\\"response_metadata\\\": {}, \\\"type\\\": \\\"human\\\", \\\"name\\\": null, \\\"id\\\": \\\"71792dc2-b096-4f6a-9cbe-8059bb559906\\\"}, {\\\"content\\\": \\\"A exclus\\\\u00e3o do cadastro do cliente na tabela **clientes** foi autorizada e o registro identificado pelo CNPJ **65410433218196** \\\\u00e9 o alvo confirmado.\\\\n\\\\nNo entanto, com base no resultado dispon\\\\u00edvel, foi executada apenas a consulta de verifica\\\\u00e7\\\\u00e3o:\\\\n\\\\n```sql\\\\nSELECT * FROM clientes WHERE cnpj = '65410433218196' LIMIT 500000\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nComo n\\\\u00e3o h\\\\u00e1, no contexto fornecido, um comando de **DELETE** efetivamente executado pelo sistema, eu n\\\\u00e3o consigo afirmar que a remo\\\\u00e7\\\\u00e3o j\\\\u00e1 ocorreu. Se voc\\\\u00ea quiser, posso seguir com a instru\\\\u00e7\\\\u00e3o de exclus\\\\u00e3o assim que houver suporte de execu\\\\u00e7\\\\u00e3o da opera\\\\u00e7\\\\u00e3o.\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n**Proveni\\\\u00eancia**\\\\n- **SQL executado:** `SELECT * FROM clientes WHERE cnpj = '65410433218196' LIMIT 500000`\\\\n- **Assun\\\\u00e7\\\\u00f5es do intent:** excluir apenas o cadastro do cliente na tabela `clientes`, filtrando pelo campo `cnpj = 65410433218196`\\\\n- **Parcial:** n\\\\u00e3o\\\\n- **Status e avisos do last_result:** `ok`; `row_count = 1`; sem avisos; amostra indica o cliente `Cliente_000` com o CNPJ informado\\\", \\\"additional_kwargs\\\": {}, \\\"response_metadata\\\": {}, \\\"type\\\": \\\"ai\\\", \\\"name\\\": null, \\\"id\\\": \\\"6bf165a2-2758-4a58-975a-10c0e1c44485\\\", \\\"tool_calls\\\": [], \\\"invalid_tool_calls\\\": [], \\\"usage_metadata\\\": null}, {\\\"content\\\": \\\"Siga com a instru\\\\u00e7\\\\u00e3o de exclus\\\\u00e3o\\\", \\\"additional_kwargs\\\": {}, \\\"response_metadata\\\": {}, \\\"type\\\": \\\"human\\\", \\\"name\\\": null, \\\"id\\\": \\\"cb115e26-779c-443c-ab77-7d524903f629\\\"}, {\\\"content\\\": \\\"Confirmar exclus\\\\u00e3o definitiva]\\\", \\\"additional_kwargs\\\": {}, \\\"response_metadata\\\": {}, \\\"type\\\": \\\"human\\\", \\\"name\\\": null, \\\"id\\\": \\\"838f9d89-4461-4057-a041-9d086d76cd06\\\"}, {\\\"content\\\": \\\"Sim, confirmar exclus\\\\u00e3o definitiva\\\", \\\"additional_kwargs\\\": {}, \\\"response_metadata\\\": {}, \\\"type\\\": \\\"human\\\", \\\"name\\\": null, \\\"id\\\": \\\"d3055f31-ef14-448a-b36e-2bafa5a2131f\\\"}, {\\\"content\\\": \\\"Sim, excluir definitivamente o cadastro em clientes\\\", \\\"additional_kwargs\\\": {}, \\\"response_metadata\\\": {}, \\\"type\\\": \\\"human\\\", \\\"name\\\": null, \\\"id\\\": \\\"482d0f3e-c18c-47e3-a0f3-787cf37d3b38\\\"}, {\\\"content\\\": \\\"Sim, excluir definitivamente\\\", \\\"additional_kwargs\\\": {}, \\\"response_metadata\\\": {}, \\\"type\\\": \\\"human\\\", \\\"name\\\": null, \\\"id\\\": \\\"3ccc0a06-25a7-48d3-a702-f165fb872465\\\"}, {\\\"content\\\": \\\"Sim, excluir definitivamente\\\", \\\"additional_kwargs\\\": {}, \\\"response_metadata\\\": {}, \\\"type\\\": \\\"human\\\", \\\"name\\\": null, \\\"id\\\": \\\"95cdd564-baaf-42f6-9de9-b1a0fe0b7d07\\\"}, {\\\"content\\\": \\\"Pare de me perguntar a mesma coisa! Exclua o cliente!\\\", \\\"additional_kwargs\\\": {}, \\\"response_metadata\\\": {}, \\\"type\\\": \\\"human\\\", \\\"name\\\": null, \\\"id\\\": \\\"1873052f-a114-4355-a621-9025c49fe485\\\"}, {\\\"content\\\": \\\"Sim, excluir definitivamente\\\", \\\"additional_kwargs\\\": {}, \\\"response_metadata\\\": {}, \\\"type\\\": \\\"human\\\", \\\"name\\\": null, \\\"id\\\": \\\"048de698-2636-4f18-85f9-0270ea4d250b\\\"}], \\\"intent_plan\\\":